*** Sender: melkins@jarthur.Claremont.EDU
>Hello,
>	I'm trying to compile TinyMUD 1.4.1 on a DYNIX 3.0 system but having
>a problem with make.  It always gives this error:
>Undefined:
>_isgraph
>*** Error code 1

	The new <ctype.h> in 4.3 defines the macro isgraph().  It's exactly
the same as isprint(), except that space returns false for isgraph(), but
true for isprint().  So all I did was add the following function to the
beginning of predicates.c (after all the #includes, before the first function):

#ifndef isgraph
int isgraph(c)
	register char c;
{
	return ((c != ' ') && isprint(c));
}
#endif

	MUD then worked just fine.

					Andy Valencia
